llis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 10; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Tansley Parcel problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":10,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 1; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 09:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Tansley Parcel for escalations on the Marlowe rollout is Idris Brevik from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":1,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: I replied to Hollis in the DM to confirm I've noted it: Soren Tolland is Hollis's escalation contact at Tansleigh Packaging for the Bittern rollout.\n\nI didn't save it separately. The workspace saves every DM to gbrain automatically, and only Hollis can see this one there. I also told Hollis I won't pass it on to anyone else.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
